(Software Architecture and Design Specification \(SAD\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Introduction) Tj
T*
(This document describes the architecture, design decisions, component interfaces and security) Tj
T*
(controls of the coursework reservation system. Audience: developers, testers and evaluators. Related) Tj
T*
(documents: Documents/Software_Requirements_Specification.md, Documents/Software_Test_Plan.md,) Tj
T*
(docs/PROJECT_DOCUMENTATION.md.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Architecture) Tj
T*
(2.1 Goals, stakeholders and constraints) Tj
T*
(Goals: correct seat allocation, transaction consistency, maintainable modules, secure) Tj
T*
(passenger/admin access and a usable booking workflow. Stakeholders: passengers, administrators,) Tj
T*
(developers and evaluators. Constraints: existing MySQL schema, simulated payments, local development) Tj
T*
(environment, no guaranteed production failover.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.2 UML component diagram) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(mermaid) Tj
T*
(flowchart TB) Tj
T*
(User[Passenger or Administrator] --> UI[React / Vite user interface]) Tj
T*
(UI --> API[Django REST Framework API]) Tj
T*
(API --> Auth[Session, CSRF and role checks]) Tj
T*
(API --> Search[Train search and seat availability]) Tj
T*
(API --> Booking[Booking and fare]) Tj
T*
(API --> Payment[Simulated payment]) Tj
T*
(API --> Cancel[Cancellation and pending refunds]) Tj
T*
(API --> Admin[Administrator management]) Tj
T*
(Search --> DB[\(MySQL / InnoDB\)]) Tj
T*
(Booking --> DB) Tj
T*
(Payment --> DB) Tj
T*
(Cancel --> DB) Tj
T*
(Admin --> DB) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(See Documents/Component_Diagram.dot for the editable diagram source.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.3 Component descriptions) Tj
T*
(|  Component  |  Responsibility  |) Tj
T*
(| --- | --- |) Tj
T*
(|  React frontend  |  Forms, search, booking steps, passenger history and admin dashboard  |) Tj
T*
(|  Django API views  |  HTTP parsing, session/role enforcement, error-to-response mapping  |) Tj
T*
(|  Search and availability  |  Schedules, fares, occupancy and overlapping segment checks  |) Tj
T*
(|  Booking service  |  Lock inventory, create PNR, passenger rows and temporary seat holds  |) Tj
T*
(|  Payment service  |  Verify holds and atomically confirm booking and seats; queue notifications  |) Tj
T*
(|  Cancellation/refund services  |  Release allocations, record cancellations and pending refunds  |) Tj
T*
(|  Admin services  |  Manage trains, stations, routes, schedules, inventory and record views  |) Tj
T*
(|  MySQL/InnoDB  |  Durable rows, foreign keys, unique constraints, transactions and locks  |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.4 Architecture pattern and rationale) Tj
T*
(Layered modular monolith: React presentation, Django HTTP boundary, feature-specific domain) Tj
T*
(services, and MySQL persistence. This limits operational complexity relative to microservices and) Tj
T*
(keeps transaction boundaries within one database. Feature modules are separated by responsibility;) Tj
T*
(shared input primitives live in backend/app/validation.py.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.5 Technology stack and data stores) Tj
T*
(React 19, Vite, Django 5.2, Django REST Framework, Python 3.10+, MySQL 8.0.16+ and) Tj
T*
(mysql-connector-python. The schema is versioned in database/schema.sql and database/migrations/, not) Tj
T*
(generated through Django ORM migrations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
