(2.6 Risks and mitigation) Tj
T*
(|  Risk  |  Mitigation / limitation  |) Tj
T*
(| --- | --- |) Tj
T*
(|  Concurrent users double-book a seat  |  Inventory row locks, overlapping-segment checks, atomic) Tj
T*
(commit  |) Tj
T*
(|  Browser retries create duplicates  |  Idempotency and unique PNR handling  |) Tj
T*
(|  Payment fails after booking hold  |  Pending state and safe retry/expiry handling  |) Tj
T*
(|  Database unavailable  |  Controlled errors and DB health endpoint; no automatic failover  |) Tj
T*
(|  Secrets exposed  |  Environment-based secrets, production HTTPS and secure cookies  |) Tj
T*
(|  Scope misunderstood  |  Label payment as simulated, refunds as pending, notifications as queued ) Tj
T*
(|) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.7 Traceability) Tj
T*
(SRS F-001 003 maps to authentication/views; F-004 006 to search/availability; F-007 010 to) Tj
T*
(booking/fare; F-011 and F-015 to payment; F-012 014 to history/cancellation/refunds; F-016 019 to) Tj
T*
(admin services; F-020 to health endpoints. SRS security requirements map to Django settings,) Tj
T*
(authorization checks, parameterized SQL and transaction services.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.8 Security architecture \(STRIDE\)) Tj
T*
(- Spoofing: authenticated sessions, hashed passwords, administrator role validation.) Tj
T*
(- Tampering: CSRF validation, parameterized SQL, input validation, InnoDB transactions.) Tj
T*
(- Repudiation: booking, payment, cancellation and refund records; full security audit log not) Tj
T*
(established.) Tj
T*
(- Information disclosure: passenger ownership checks, HttpOnly cookies, HTTPS deployment) Tj
T*
(requirement.) Tj
T*
(- Denial of service: validation and bounded search results; rate limiting is not established.) Tj
T*
(- Elevation of privilege: server-side role checks; public registration cannot create admin accounts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Detailed design) Tj
T*
(3.1 Booking and confirmation sequence) Tj
T*
(mermaid) Tj
T*
(sequenceDiagram) Tj
T*
(actor P as Passenger) Tj
T*
(participant UI as React) Tj
T*
(participant API as Django API) Tj
T*
(participant B as Booking service) Tj
T*
(participant Pay as Payment service) Tj
T*
(participant DB as MySQL) Tj
T*
(P->>UI: Select train and enter passengers) Tj
T*
(UI->>API: POST /api/bookings) Tj
T*
(API->>B: Validate request) Tj
T*
(B->>DB: BEGIN; lock inventory; create booking, passengers and HELD seats) Tj
T*
(DB-->>B: Commit PNR) Tj
T*
(B-->>API: Pending booking and PNR) Tj
T*
(API-->>UI: Pending confirmation) Tj
T*
(P->>UI: Confirm simulated payment) Tj
T*
(UI->>API: POST /api/bookings/{id}/pay) Tj
T*
(API->>Pay: Validate ownership and active holds) Tj
T*
(Pay->>DB: BEGIN; lock booking/seats; record payment; confirm seats and booking; queue notifications) Tj
T*
(DB-->>Pay: Commit) Tj
T*
(Pay-->>UI: Confirmed booking) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.2 Cancellation sequence) Tj
T*
(mermaid) Tj
T*
(sequenceDiagram) Tj
T*
(actor P as Passenger) Tj
T*
(participant UI as React) Tj
T*
(participant API as Django API) Tj
